    "role": "Qliphothic Cataclysm (Golachab — Greater)",
    "tier": 4,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>Not a creature of flesh but a conflagration of pure hate: a sentient cataclysm born from an act of mass immolation, forever bound to the agony of its own creation. A swirling vortex of emerald-green soulfire, its flames crowded with the screaming psychic impressions of everyone it has ever burned. It does not merely want to burn you — it wants you to feel all of them.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Golachab, the Pyres — the Hull of Gevurah. The executioner's fire that never learned to stop.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'Green fire that screams. Every instinct you have about water is wrong and it knows.'</em></p>",
